tile.crafting_pattern_bus.tooltip.summary=&7ECO - FD Smart Pattern Bus is the main part of the crafting subsystem
tile.crafting_pattern_bus.tooltip.line.0=&7Each bus can store 63 patterns
tile.crafting_pattern_bus.tooltip.line.1=&7Patterns encoded in the ME Encoding Terminal can be uploaded with the adjacent button
tile.crafting_pattern_bus.tooltip.line.2=&7Current: model migrated; pattern logic pending
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.summary=&7ECO - FX Worker is the main part of the crafting subsystem
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.line.0=&7ECO - FX Worker can cache 32 crafting jobs and process 1 job per operation
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.line.1=&7When overclocking is enabled:
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.line.2=  &7Job cache capacity: &a128&7 / &b256&7 / &d512
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.line.3=  &7Power multiplier: &a×4&7 / &b×8&7 / &d×16
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.line.4=&7When active cooling is enabled:
tile.crafting_worker.tooltip.line.5=  &7Clears the negative effects of overclocking
